WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.880
Come on in, check
out MasterClass.

00:00:02.880 --> 00:00:04.710
See what we got to say to you.

00:00:04.710 --> 00:00:07.260
