00:00:07.260 --> 00:00:14.050
We have these 
complicated origins

00:00:14.050 --> 00:00:17.470
that in some ways explain why
we have the complicated present

00:00:17.470 --> 00:00:18.070
that we have.

00:00:18.070 --> 00:00:21.402
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:26.800
Critical Race Theory

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:29.260
pays attention to these
things because it's

00:00:29.260 --> 00:00:31.570
trying to get
people to understand

00:00:31.570 --> 00:00:36.310
that what we think about as
just there are never just there.

00:00:36.310 --> 00:00:37.825
They have been produced.

